{"type":"excalidraw","version":2,"source":"https://app.excalidraw.com","metadata":{"id":"7vrOsVhD1FJ","workspace":"4c8x9O2Yp2e","name":"wayward-boost-billing-payout-flow","created":"2026-07-01T20:50:11.781Z","updated":"2026-07-02T18:07:36.907Z","collection":null,"creator":"2ElKsXERQIc","updater":"2ElKsXERQIc","isPrivate":true,"pinned":false},"elements":[{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":1053084997,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t1","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":40,"y":20,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":1470,"height":31,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":25,"fontFamily":2,"text":"Invoicing infra — event log → BigQuery ledger → invoice (ACC + Associates)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Invoicing infra — event log → BigQuery ledger → invoice (ACC + Associates)","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"a0","autoResize":true},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":380458379,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t2","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":40,"y":56,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":1830,"height":37,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"How a sale in the fetchers event log becomes an invoice. The billing LEDGER is a BigQuery model (immutable, reproducible, windowed on to_ingest_time); the mutable invoice DOCUMENT + Stripe come later. Focus = Amazon\nCreator Connections (ACC) and Associates. Rates/identity read via the federated `adservice` dataset — no data movement. Data-model (foreign keys) below.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"How a sale in the fetchers event log becomes an invoice. The billing LEDGER is a BigQuery model (immutable, reproducible, windowed on to_ingest_time); the mutable invoice DOCUMENT + Stripe come later. Focus = Amazon\nCreator Connections (ACC) and Associates. Rates/identity read via the federated `adservice` dataset — no data movement. Data-model (foreign keys) below.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"a1","autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":2,"versionNonce":1973738661,"isDeleted":false,"id":"r3","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":560,"y":195,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#a5d8ff","width":640,"height":158,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"a2"},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":1226861611,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t4","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":208,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":23,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"text":"① Source — fetcher report pulls (per program)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"① Source — fetcher report pulls (per program)","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"a3","autoResize":true},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":680263685,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t5","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":239,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":93,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"Temporal workflows pull each program's reports to GCS:\n• ACC — fetch-acc-connections workflow (Creator Connections client).\n• Associates — Amazon Associates report pulls.\nAttribution (amazon_attribution_products) is the BUILT reference; ACC +\nAssociates event-log tables are to build.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Temporal workflows pull each program's reports to GCS:\n• ACC — fetch-acc-connections workflow (Creator Connections client).\n• Associates — Amazon Associates report pulls.\nAttribution (amazon_attribution_products) is the BUILT reference; ACC +\nAssociates event-log tables are to build.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"a4","autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":2,"versionNonce":1983360715,"isDeleted":false,"id":"r6","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":560,"y":405,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#ffec99","width":640,"height":177,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"a5"},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":1836562277,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t7","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":418,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":23,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"text":"② BigQuery fetchers pipeline","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"② BigQuery fetchers pipeline","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"a6","autoResize":true},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":277716331,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t8","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":449,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":112,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"gcs -> fetchers_raw -> fetchers_unpacked -> fetchers_clean ->\nfetchers_event_log\n• clean VIEW applies ownership filter (campaign_id 'wyrd_'/'wywrdboost_')\n-> log is pre-scoped.\n• event_log = append-only SIGNED-DELTA rows, partitioned by diff_time,\nwatermarked by to_ingest_time; SUM(delta) per granule = current value.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"gcs -> fetchers_raw -> fetchers_unpacked -> fetchers_clean ->\nfetchers_event_log\n• clean VIEW applies ownership filter (campaign_id 'wyrd_'/'wywrdboost_')\n-> log is pre-scoped.\n• event_log = append-only SIGNED-DELTA rows, partitioned by diff_time,\nwatermarked by to_ingest_time; SUM(delta) per granule = current value.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"a7","autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":2,"versionNonce":1052082885,"isDeleted":false,"id":"r9","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":560,"y":634,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#ffd8a8","width":640,"height":252,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"a8"},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":1399633931,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t10","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":647,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":23,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"text":"③ Billing ledger — BigQuery","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"③ Billing ledger — BigQuery","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"a9","autoResize":true},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":1893917221,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t11","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":678,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":187,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"Incremental BQ model over window (last_invoiced, cutoff] on\nto_ingest_time:\n• SUM(delta sales) per (account, event_date, product, source)\n• map account_id (=seller_account_id) -> seller_account ->\naccounts.account_id (abstract brand)\n• JOIN federated config (left) to price each line:\n   commission = dSales x commission rate @ event_date -> creator\n   usage_fee  = dSales x brand_usage_rate            -> Wayward\n   apply creator_eligibility. Immutable; returns = negative deltas ->\ncredits.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Incremental BQ model over window (last_invoiced, cutoff] on\nto_ingest_time:\n• SUM(delta sales) per (account, event_date, product, source)\n• map account_id (=seller_account_id) -> seller_account ->\naccounts.account_id (abstract brand)\n• JOIN federated config (left) to price each line:\n   commission = dSales x commission rate @ event_date -> creator\n   usage_fee  = dSales x brand_usage_rate            -> Wayward\n   apply creator_eligibility. Immutable; returns = negative deltas ->\ncredits.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aA","autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":2,"versionNonce":751795883,"isDeleted":false,"id":"r12","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":560,"y":938,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#d0bfff","width":640,"height":215,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aB"},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":1760384389,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t13","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":951,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":23,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"text":"④ What ONE invoice IS (in infra)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"④ What ONE invoice IS (in infra)","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aC","autoResize":true},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":1734373707,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t14","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":982,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":150,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"One invoice = per (account_id = abstract brand, source, window). Two\nappend-only BQ tables:\n• invoice (header): invoice_id, account_id, source,\nperiod_from/to_ingest_time, currency, total_amount, status\n• invoice_line: invoice_id, event_date, retailer_product_id, delta_sales,\ncommission (->creator), usage_fee (->Wayward), amount  [per product per\nevent_date]\nCorrections = a NEW invoice over a later window, never an edit.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"One invoice = per (account_id = abstract brand, source, window). Two\nappend-only BQ tables:\n• invoice (header): invoice_id, account_id, source,\nperiod_from/to_ingest_time, currency, total_amount, status\n• invoice_line: invoice_id, event_date, retailer_product_id, delta_sales,\ncommission (->creator), usage_fee (->Wayward), amount  [per product per\nevent_date]\nCorrections = a NEW invoice over a later window, never an edit.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aD","autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":2,"versionNonce":303193317,"isDeleted":false,"id":"r15","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":560,"y":1205,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#eebefa","width":640,"height":196,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aE"},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":343543787,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t16","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":1218,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":23,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"text":"⑤ Invoice lifecycle","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"⑤ Invoice lifecycle","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aF","autoResize":true},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":333412421,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t17","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":576,"y":1249,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":610,"height":131,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"1. COMPUTED in the BQ ledger (immutable).\n2. DOCUMENT — Postgres `invoice` table (status/sent/paid/stripe_id;\nlater).\n3. DRAFT -> Stripe (per brand Stripe customer).\n4. REVIEW -> HELD/APPROVED -> FINALIZED -> SENT (WAY-2407).\n5. PAID / PAYMENT_FAILED via webhooks.\n6. Cursor advances; returns flow into next window.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"1. COMPUTED in the BQ ledger (immutable).\n2. DOCUMENT — Postgres `invoice` table (status/sent/paid/stripe_id;\nlater).\n3. DRAFT -> Stripe (per brand Stripe customer).\n4. REVIEW -> HELD/APPROVED -> FINALIZED -> SENT (WAY-2407).\n5. PAID / PAYMENT_FAILED via webhooks.\n6. Cursor advances; returns flow into next window.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aG","autoResize":true},{"type":"arrow","version":2,"versionNonce":908515979,"isDeleted":false,"id":"a18","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":880,"y":353,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":0,"height":52,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":2},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[0,52]],"lastCommittedPoint":null,"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","index":"aH"},{"type":"arrow","version":2,"versionNonce":1211246501,"isDeleted":false,"id":"a19","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":880,"y":582,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":0,"height":52,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":2},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[0,52]],"lastCommittedPoint":null,"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","index":"aI"},{"type":"arrow","version":2,"versionNonce":690049323,"isDeleted":false,"id":"a20","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":880,"y":886,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":0,"height":52,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":2},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[0,52]],"lastCommittedPoint":null,"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","index":"aJ"},{"type":"arrow","version":2,"versionNonce":1899490053,"isDeleted":false,"id":"a21","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":880,"y":1153,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":0,"height":52,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":2},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[0,52]],"lastCommittedPoint":null,"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","index":"aK"},{"type":"rectangle","version":2,"versionNonce":1322513355,"isDeleted":false,"id":"r22","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":40,"y":634,"strokeColor":"#2b8a3e","backgroundColor":"#b2f2bb","width":500,"height":252,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aL"},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":795755109,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t23","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":56,"y":647,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":470,"height":47,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"text":"Federated config — `adservice` dataset (read\nin BQ)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Federated config — `adservice` dataset (read\nin BQ)","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aM","autoResize":true},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":2002338411,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t24","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":56,"y":702,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":470,"height":225,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"Postgres tables mirrored into BQ (devops/data/index.ts);\nthe ledger JOINs natively.\nEntities: account, seller_account, retailer_product,\nintegration (program).\nRates & enablement (WAY-2287):\n• brand_commission — brand default %\n• product_commission — per product (+/- creator)\n• brand_usage_rate — Wayward fee (one table, all\nprograms)\n• product_enablement — product in program?\n• brand_program_enablement — brand in program?\n• creator_eligibility — brand<->creator earning","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Postgres tables mirrored into BQ (devops/data/index.ts);\nthe ledger JOINs natively.\nEntities: account, seller_account, retailer_product,\nintegration (program).\nRates & enablement (WAY-2287):\n• brand_commission — brand default %\n• product_commission — per product (+/- creator)\n• brand_usage_rate — Wayward fee (one table, all\nprograms)\n• product_enablement — product in program?\n• brand_program_enablement — brand in program?\n• creator_eligibility — brand<->creator earning","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aN","autoResize":true},{"type":"arrow","version":2,"versionNonce":933408197,"isDeleted":false,"id":"a25","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":540,"y":760,"strokeColor":"#2b8a3e","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":20,"height":0,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":2},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[20,0]],"lastCommittedPoint":null,"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","index":"aO"},{"type":"rectangle","version":2,"versionNonce":192658699,"isDeleted":false,"id":"r26","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":1230,"y":195,"strokeColor":"#868e96","backgroundColor":"#f1f3f5","width":650,"height":140,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aP"},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":1223863589,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t27","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":1246,"y":208,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":620,"height":23,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"text":"Two date axes","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Two date axes","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aQ","autoResize":true},{"type":"text","version":2,"versionNonce":1991631787,"isDeleted":false,"id":"t28","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":1246,"y":239,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":620,"height":75,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"• to_ingest_time — INVOICING CURSOR: half-open windows (last, cutoff];\nmonotonic; ties to a real fetch snapshot.\n• event_date — original ad date: picks the rate & eligibility in force and\nsplits lines per period. Restatements keep their event_date.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"• to_ingest_time — INVOICING CURSOR: half-open windows (last, cutoff];\nmonotonic; ties to a real fetch snapshot.\n• event_date — original ad date: picks the rate & eligibility in force and\nsplits lines per period. Restatements keep their event_date.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aR","autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":2,"versionNonce":1657520261,"isDeleted":false,"id":"r29","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":1230,"y":363,"strokeColor":"#868e96","backgroundColor":"#f1f3f5","width":650,"height":158,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1782939011781,"li