421,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":" Brand invoice - Amazon Attribution\n  commission = Σ sales_delta × commission_rate(product, [creator], event_date)   → creator\n  usage_fee  = Σ sales_delta × brand_usage_rate(brand, event_date)               → Wayward\n  invoice    = commission + usage_fee\n  Creator payout = Σ (that creator's sales_delta) × commission_rate — the whole commission.\n\n  Worked example: brand default 10%, usage 3%, Jane drives $10,000.\n  - commission $1,000 → Jane · usage $300 → Wayward · brand invoice $1,300.\n  - Wayward collects $1,300, pays Jane $1,000, keeps $300.","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":" Brand invoice - Amazon Attribution\n  commission = Σ sales_delta × commission_rate(product, [creator], event_date)   → creator\n  usage_fee  = Σ sales_delta × brand_usage_rate(brand, event_date)               → Wayward\n  invoice    = commission + usage_fee\n  Creator payout = Σ (that creator's sales_delta) × commission_rate — the whole commission.\n\n  Worked example: brand default 10%, usage 3%, Jane drives $10,000.\n  - commission $1,000 → Jane · usage $300 → Wayward · brand invoice $1,300.\n  - Wayward collects $1,300, pays Jane $1,000, keeps $300.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"qxoOnTLwZm7Fa93m5pRuu","type":"text","x":2307.667105607545,"y":566.126627136172,"width":1695.818603515625,"height":455,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b0c","roundness":null,"seed":1548236043,"version":35,"versionNonce":2015672325,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782940404930,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"  Brand invoice - Amazon Creator Connections\n  effective_commission = max(acc_bonus_rate − cc_rate, 0) × GMV    → creator (the top-up)\n  usage_fee            = GMV × brand_usage_rate                    → Wayward\n  invoice              = effective_commission + usage_fee          \n  Creator payout (via Wayward) = effective_commission (just the top-up).\n  Creator's total earning = cc (from Amazon, direct) + effective_commission (from Wayward).\n\n  Worked example: Amazon CC pays 15%, brand ACC target 20%, usage 3%, $10,000 ACC GMV.\n  - Amazon pays the creator 15% = $1,500 directly (never touches Wayward's books).\n  - effective_commission = max(20% − 15%, 0) = 5% = $500 → billed to brand, paid to creator via Wayward.\n  - usage_fee = 3% = $300 → Wayward.\n  - brand invoice = $500 + $300 = $800.\n  - Creator total = $1,500 (Amazon) + $500 (Wayward) = $2,000 (=20%). Wayward collects $800, pays the creator $500, keeps $300.","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"  Brand invoice - Amazon Creator Connections\n  effective_commission = max(acc_bonus_rate − cc_rate, 0) × GMV    → creator (the top-up)\n  usage_fee            = GMV × brand_usage_rate                    → Wayward\n  invoice              = effective_commission + usage_fee          \n  Creator payout (via Wayward) = effective_commission (just the top-up).\n  Creator's total earning = cc (from Amazon, direct) + effective_commission (from Wayward).\n\n  Worked example: Amazon CC pays 15%, brand ACC target 20%, usage 3%, $10,000 ACC GMV.\n  - Amazon pays the creator 15% = $1,500 directly (never touches Wayward's books).\n  - effective_commission = max(20% − 15%, 0) = 5% = $500 → billed to brand, paid to creator via Wayward.\n  - usage_fee = 3% = $300 → Wayward.\n  - brand invoice = $500 + $300 = $800.\n  - Creator total = $1,500 (Amazon) + $500 (Wayward) = $2,000 (=20%). Wayward collects $800, pays the creator $500, keeps $300.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"fldRhf-kU-TSXrEOvAlXX","type":"text","x":2039.834639483341,"y":-451.99428681832643,"width":1628.170654296875,"height":210,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b0d","roundness":null,"seed":295082533,"version":416,"versionNonce":1648176011,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782940768338,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Amazon Attribution - measurement tool\n- gives tracking tags for off-Amazon paid ads so you can attribute Amazon sales back to those campaigns - only measures\n\nAmazon Creator Connections - creator commission program Amazon runs\n- brand offers commissions, creator promote via their own content; Amazon tracks it and pays the creator the commission directly\n- Wayward has a usage fee on GMV","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Amazon Attribution - measurement tool\n- gives tracking tags for off-Amazon paid ads so you can attribute Amazon sales back to those campaigns - only measures\n\nAmazon Creator Connections - creator commission program Amazon runs\n- brand offers commissions, creator promote via their own content; Amazon tracks it and pays the creator the commission directly\n- Wayward has a usage fee on GMV","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"HHSmAjr7EuHXpNS9ptU7-","type":"rectangle","x":4354.468802221617,"y":187.46328356242282,"width":331.0241248222874,"height":97.23242804964735,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b0e","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1601128429,"version":40,"versionNonce":1906004973,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"UXPorDYLsTUCyY18sCXc-"}],"updated":1783014057932,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"UXPorDYLsTUCyY18sCXc-","type":"text","x":4458.870894539987,"y":218.5794975872465,"width":122.21994018554688,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":